# The live DB is no longer git-tracked directly (2026-09-17) - committing a
# WAL-mode SQLite file mid-write risks a torn/inconsistent copy, and every
# server start/stop rewrote its page layout with zero logical change,
# producing constant no-op-looking diffs. The real backup path is
# db_snapshot.py's SQLite .backup-API copy -> Syncthing -> the NAS (see
# CHECKPOINT.md and the backup-infrastructure memory) - git tracks code,
# not this file.
vessel_local.db
vessel_local.db-wal
vessel_local.db-shm

